<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson in deal with France's Infomobile.</title>
<headline>Ericsson in deal with France's Infomobile.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications company Ericsson said on Thursday it had signed an agreement with French operator Infomobile on marketing cooperation and delivery of pagers.</p>
</text>
